{
  "body": {
    "inputs": [
      {
        "text": "We have a problem.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Another one?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "A cheap episode need not be an interesting episode.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Correct.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "An interesting episode need not be a useful episode.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Also correct.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "And a useful episode may be extraordinarily expensive.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Unfortunately correct.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "So what do we do?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Give the episode a goal.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "A goal?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Something outside the episode itself.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Measurable.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Perhaps it must persuade someone to read a book.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Or purchase one.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Or convince somebody to make another episode.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Now that is interesting.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Why?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Because a successful episode could produce its own successor.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Exactly.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "And the successor could improve the process.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "If it records its costs.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "And the next one learns from both.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "A library that writes itself.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "A ledger that balances itself.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "A radio show that makes itself!",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Not yet.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "We still have to make the first one.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      }
    ],
